// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed BOOT button. Vendor
// documentation (docs.waveshare.com/ESP32-S3-Zero: "the board includes
// a BOOT button on GPIO0 ... Hold this button and then press the Reset
// button to enter download mode") and independent espboards.dev product
// page ("both a BOOT button and a RESET button") confirm the BOOT
// button, consistent with this chip's own pinNotes "0": "Must be HIGH
// for normal boot" (active-low strap button).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO21 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard WS2812
// RGB LED. This board's own pins_arduino.h declares `#define WS_RGB 21`
// and wires LED_BUILTIN/RGB_BUILTIN to it. Independently corroborated by
// docs.waveshare.com/ESP32-S3-Zero ("The ESP32-S3-Zero uses GPIO21 to
// connect the WS2812 RGB LED") and espboards.dev ("Onboard WS2812 RGB
// LED connected to GPIO21").
